1. **Create a custom RadioButton control:**

First, create a custom RadioButton control that inherits from RadioButton in your shared code (PCL or .NET Standard library).

```csharp
public class CustomRadioButton : RadioButton
{
    public static readonly BindableProperty TintColorProperty =
        BindableProperty.Create(nameof(TintColor), typeof(Color), typeof(CustomRadioButton), Color.Default);

    public Color TintColor
    {
        get { return (Color)GetValue(TintColorProperty); }
        set { SetValue(TintColorProperty, value); }
    }
}
```

